      "description": "A neutral state label; domain variants use existing semantic tokens.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-chip\">Unknown</span>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:var(--s1);font:600 11px/1 var(--font-ui);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;padding:3px 11px;border-radius:var(--r-badge);border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink-2);white-space:nowrap}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Supporting Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "Shared panel with the supporting rail inset.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h2 class=\"ds-panel-title\">Upcoming</h2><p class=\"ds-panel-copy\">No scheduled conversations.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-panel);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:none}.ds-panel-title{margin:0 0 18px;font:600 15px/1.4 var(--font-ui)}.ds-panel-copy{margin:0;font:400 14px/1.5 var(--font-ui);color:var(--ink-2)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Application Count Filter",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "application-filter",
      "description": "One of six native count filters; selected state uses aria-pressed. Live behavior is provided by widgets.js in the application.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-filter\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-filter-count\">6</span><span class=\"ds-filter-label\">Saved</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-filter{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-ctl);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color var(--motion-state),border-color var(--motion-state),transform var(--motion-press) var(--ease-widget)}.ds-filter[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-ink)}.ds-filter:hover{border-color:var(--accent-line)}.ds-filter:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}.ds-filter:active:not(:disabled){transform:scale(.975)}.ds-filter-count{font:600 24px/1.2 var(--font-ui)}.ds-filter-label{font:500 12px/1.4 var(--font-ui)}@media(max-width:640px){.ds-filter{padding:14px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-filter{transition:none}.ds-filter:active:not(:disabled){transform:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Contact Roster Row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "contact-roster-row",
      "description": "Identity, firm context, and visible actions in a divided roster; no individual rounded card.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-roster\"><a class=\"ds-roster-person\" href=\"#contact\">Alex Chen</a><span class=\"ds-roster-firm\">Example firm \u00b7 Analyst</span><a class=\"ds-roster-action\" href=\"#interaction\">Log interaction</a></article>",
      "css": ".ds-roster{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(230px,1fr) minmax(160px,.8fr) minmax(220px,auto);align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:88px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;padding:17px 22px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);font:400 13px/1.5 var(--font-ui)}.ds-roster:hover{background:var(--paper)}.ds-roster-person{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}.ds-roster-firm{color:var(--ink-2)}.ds-roster-action{color:var(--ink);padding:6px 9px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:var(--r-ctl);font:600 12px/1.2 var(--font-ui);text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:34px}.ds-roster-action:hover{border-color:var(--ink-3)}.ds-roster a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:1200px){.ds-roster{grid-template-columns:minmax(220px,1fr) minmax(150px,.8fr)}.ds-roster-action{grid-column:1/-1;justify-self:start}}@media(max-width:640px){.ds-roster{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);padding:18px 16px;min-height:0}.ds-roster-action{min-height:40px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Assistant Prompt List",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "assistant-prompt",
      "description": "One enclosing surface with divided, full-row starter buttons.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-prompts\"><button class=\"ds-prompt\">Help me plan my next follow-up<svg class=\"ds-prompt-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.65\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-prompt\">Review my upcoming deadlines<svg class=\"ds-prompt-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.65\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-prompts{display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-panel);overflow:hidden}.ds-prompt{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:16px 18px;min-height:56px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);font:400 13px/1.5 var(--font-ui);cursor:pointer;text-align:left}.ds-prompt:last-child{border-bottom:0}.ds-prompt:hover{background:var(--paper)}.ds-prompt:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}.ds-prompt:active{transform:scale(.975)}.ds-prompt-arrow{width:16px;height:16px;flex:none;color:var(--ink-3);transition:transform var(--motion-state) var(--ease-widget)}.ds-prompt:hover .ds-prompt-arrow{color:var(--accent);transform:translateX(3px)}@media(max-width:640px){.ds-prompt{padding:14px 16px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-prompt:active,.ds-prompt:hover .ds-prompt-arrow{transform:none}.ds-prompt-arrow{transition:none}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "A Clear Recruiting Workspace",
    "overview": "Coverage presents a clear recruiting workspace: destinations on the left, the current task in front, supporting context beside it. Cool surfaces, slate text, precise blue selection, and quiet borders make dense recruiting records easy to scan.\n\nThis records the implemented September 2026 refurbishment. New shared visual work follows this document and `coverage_web/static/css/workspace.css`, loaded after route styles in `coverage_web/templates/base.html`. Base primitives, semantic status palettes, and self-hosted fonts remain in `coverage_web/static/css/coverage.css`. Route-specific structure still belongs to its templates. Historical visual prescriptions in `docs/design-spec.md` and `design-system/coverage/MASTER.md` are subordinate; their product and functional contracts are not replaced.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Sans-serif page hierarchy and controls.",
      "Blue selection and actions; separate semantic status colors.",
      "Flat bordered surfaces with persistent row actions.",
      "Responsive navigation and both color schemes."
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the current CSS variables so explicit and system-selected dark themes stay paired.",
      "Do keep role and contact actions visible without hover, with the existing larger mobile targets.",
      "Do preserve keyboard focus, native controls, disclosure state, and reduced-motion behavior.",
      "Do use the shared panel and button primitives before adding route-specific styling."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't reintroduce the historical masthead rule, serif workspace titles, or page-header eyebrows.",
      "Don't replace state labels with color alone or restyle unknown facts as confirmed outcomes.",
      "Don't copy old palette values or hover lifts from historical documentation into new screens."
    ]
  }
}
